  "description": "A managed C# read-only library for reading and extracting PlayStation Portable PBP (EBOOT.PBP) files. Supports single-disc and multi-disc PBP, SFO metadata parsing, and ISO extraction with CUE sheet generation. Designed as an intermediate step for converting PBP discs to other formats (e.g. CHD). Read-only: it can open and extract, but cannot create or modify PBP files.",
